WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.418 --> 00:00:03.118
Unit sixteen. Alcohol and Driving!

2
00:00:04.034 --> 00:00:07.775
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.825 --> 00:00:10.894
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:14.459
Today we learn about Alcohol and Driving. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.327 --> 00:00:18.760
Alcohol. Say it with me. Alcohol!

6
00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:25.700
Reaction time. Say it with me. Reaction time!

7
00:00:29.157 --> 00:00:32.207
Judgment. Say it with me. Judgment!

8
00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.893
Crash. Say it with me. Crash!

9
00:00:42.425 --> 00:00:45.875
Drink driving. Say it with me. Drink driving!

10
00:00:49.377 --> 00:00:52.761
Passenger. Say it with me. Passenger!

11
00:00:56.271 --> 00:00:59.604
Law. Say it with me. Law!

12
00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:07.155
Designated driver. Say it with me. Designated driver!

13
00:01:10.607 --> 00:01:21.091
Alcohol slows reaction time and weakens judgment, causing many crashes. Drink driving is illegal and dangerous. Passengers should never ride with a drinking driver — choose a designated driver.

14
00:01:21.141 --> 00:01:23.892
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:25.304 --> 00:01:30.566
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.616 --> 00:01:31.733
Judgment!

17
00:01:32.451 --> 00:01:37.513
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:38.667
Law!

19
00:01:39.362 --> 00:01:43.796
Did you know? Even small amounts of alcohol can affect driving skills!

20
00:01:43.846 --> 00:01:45.957
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.224 --> 00:01:55.034
Think and answer. What can you do if the driver has been drinking?

22
00:01:55.084 --> 00:01:56.234
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.325 --> 00:02:01.833
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.883 --> 00:02:04.358
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

